<title>UK: Venezuela sets 650 million mark seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Venezuela sets 650 million mark seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Westdeutsche Landesbank GZ.</p>
<p> BORROWER   VENEZUELA</p>
<p> AMT    650 MLN DEM   COUPON     10.25     MATURITY    04.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.26    PAY DATE    04.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.75	REOFFER    99.76     SPREAD	+440 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BA2	 LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  B	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMS US/UK/VE/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  VENEZUELA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.50	LISTING FEE 0.50</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.00 PCT TREUHAND DUE NOV.03</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
